            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watumishi wake wakamkaribia, wakamwambia, wakasema, Baba yangu, kama yule nabii angalikuambia kutenda jambo kubwa, usingalilitenda? Je! Si zaidi basi, akikuambia, Jioshe, uwe safi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
